(text "A1 REV1 — 15V TO 5V_SYS MAIN BUCK (LM76005)" (at 270 25 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "af8602ae-e7e3-4680-b4a7-c39962958610"))
(text "U2 LM76005RNPR: 15V input, 5V/5A design target, 400kHz default; TI reference component set." (at 270 32 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "8c573dcc-de80-4173-bcac-c6ba6e954bf7"))
(text "L1=6.8uH Isat>8A; COUT=3x47uF/10V X7R; RFBT=100k, RFBB=24.9k, CFF=47pF." (at 270 37 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "25a7286b-bae0-4997-a2f6-64a1390b2a2a"))
(text "CIN=2x4.7uF/50V X7R + 47nF; CBOOT=470nF; CVCC=2.2uF; CBIAS=1uF; BIAS tied to 5V_SYS." (at 270 42 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "8da5567f-652b-40db-9e15-dbd49088120f"))
(text "EN UVLO divider RENT=732k / RENB=100k sets VIN rising threshold ~10.0V; prevents start at USB-C default 5V." (at 270 47 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "39f8fe87-717f-4d14-9f41-c694a35f9290"))
(text "TI pin 7 and 23 float; pin 19 and pins 27-30 tie to GND copper. DAP/EP must be grounded with thermal vias." (at 270 52 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "e40ad466-c3ac-4d61-b800-54391e9ba0a7"))
(text "Footprint for U2 and L1 not frozen. Validate exact WQFN land pattern, inductor Isat/DCR, thermal rise and loop stability before PCB." (at 270 57 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "256cd01d-f040-4e19-98f5-eef92752f8aa"))
(text "A1 REV1 — USB-C PD INPUT / 15V 3A" (at 25 30 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "249400de-d893-4319-b7ed-02b0b316c496")) (text "J1: USB-C receptacle, 16 signal contacts. A/B VBUS and GND contacts are individually tied." (at 25 38 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "f47cd157-b4f1-4b2f-b0ba-0904d2fff4c1")) (text "U1: HUSB238_003DD (DFN-10L). VIN decoupled by C1=1uF; CC1/CC2 and D+/D- wired per datasheet Fig.4." (at 25 43 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "1bba36b4-962d-4cbf-8032-914d28f72948")) (text "R1=14k sets 15V; R2=22.6k sets 3.0A. Device RDO is min(VSET, ISET, OTP PDO defaults)." (at 25 48 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "2e44d39c-dcf2-464e-b48c-f10c2775df89")) (text "Q1 AO4407A: source pins 1-3, gate pin4, drain pins5-8. R3=5.1k series GATE; R4=49.9k gate pull-up." (at 25 53 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "9f493874-25a4-4400-97ea-bbb924cd0cb0")) (text "Open items: confirm Q1 footprint pinout and HUSB238_003DD orderable status; add connector-side ESD, input fuse and reverse-current review." (at 25 58 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "aac26f92-e2c6-445d-9475-2bb8ba973184")) (text "PD_15V_IN proceeds to 15V-to-5V_SYS converter. Converter circuit is a separate sheet, not included here." (at 25 63 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "19f25a21-75f3-466f-87c2-52df5640cf6a"))
